    <description>After-save flow on WorkOrder (Create + Update). When Priority or EndDate changes, recalculates Priority_Score__c (formula) and pushes the new value to all child ServiceAppointments.</description>
    <interviewLabel>WO Push Priority Score To SAs {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>WO - Push Priority Score To SAs</label>
